Package: projectData.monocle3.testdata
Title: Test Fixtures for the 'projectData.monocle3' Adapter
Version: 0.0.0.9004
Authors@R: 
    person("Brad", "Blaser", , "bradley.blaser@osumc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3168-5423"))
Description: Small, deterministic, synthetic data resources used to test the
    integration of 'projectData', its 'monocle3' adapter ('projectData.monocle3')
    and 'BPCells'-backed Monocle 3 'cell_data_set' objects. Three saved
    cell_data_set directories are registered in a 'projectData' manifest and
    have lightweight placeholder objects under data/; one ordinary data frame
    has no manifest entry. Installing the package requires none of those
    packages.
